Kaggriculture Rust engine

This project includes a Rust port of the Kaggriculture simulator from
Kaggle/kaggle-environments, commit 28b6d8af3ce73926b3d0fda1410c1ddd8384ab8c.
The original Python sources and Apache-2.0 license are retained in reference/.
Rust implementation, Python bindings, batch execution and tests are additions
and modifications made in this project.
